                "choose:Yes",
                "mesbox:Tiadeche hands you his first catch",
                "player:Your father would be proud",
                "npc:Hmph",
                "player:Speaking of your father",
                "npc:I cannot return just yet",
                "player:...",
                "npc:Before I return",
                "player:And that is?",
                "npc:Take a Karambwan vessel",
